  "longBusinessSummary": "UmweltBank AG provides various banking products and services in Germany. It offers checking, saving, and call and term deposit accounts. The company also has securities offerings, including bonds, project and corporate bonds from other issuers, as well as wind power, online bank services, credit cards, investment funds and ETFs, all selected according to ecological criteria. In addition, it offers corporate banking services focused on financing renewable energy projects, such as photovoltaic systems, wind turbines, battery energy storage systems, and real estate projects, including rental apartments, commercial properties, investment projects, nursing homes, schools, kindergartens, daycare centers, and student housing. UmweltBank AG was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Nuremberg, Germany.",
